//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// LLD-only: clvl targets for crafted ilvl 51/71 and alvl 40/45 on ring & amulet bases
// Game stores these as ints (truncation), so:
//   crafted_ilvl = ILVL/2 + CLVL/2            ->  clvl = 2*(target - ILVL/2)
//   crafted_alvl = max(CI - QLVL/2, CI*2 - 99) where CI = crafted_ilvl
//     -> min CI  = MIN(target_alvl + QLVL/2, (target_alvl + 100)/2)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ItemDisplay[(MAG OR RARE) ILVL>50 STAT360=0 (rin OR amu)]: %NAME%{%CL%%NAME%%CORAL% Craft at clvl $f(2*(51-ILVL/2)) for ilvl 51%CL%%CORAL% Craft at clvl $f(2*(71-ILVL/2)) for ilvl 71%CL%%CORAL% Craft at clvl $f(2*(MIN(40+QLVL/2,70)-ILVL/2)) for alvl 40%CL%%CORAL% Craft at clvl $f(2*(MIN(45+QLVL/2,72)-ILVL/2)) for alvl 45}%CONTINUE%
